+# 2026-10-24-context-usage
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-24-context-usage.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional TokenUsage.contextUsage to separate the latest provider request's context occupancy from cumulative token accounting. The nested input includes cached input, and the nested output includes reasoning output. A null sample explicitly means occupancy is unknown.
+
